          <p>Project Samriddhi is a collaborative initiative that brings together civil society, state governments, and corporate partners to scale the success of Project Udaan—a landmark effort launched by the Rajasthan State Government in 2022. Udaan demonstrated the transformative power of pre-matric scholarships and the importance of reshaping parental attitudes toward girls' education.</p>
          <p>The expansion through Project Samriddhi reflects the urgent need to replicate these learnings across other high-need states.</p>
          <p>The need for Project Samriddhi is underscored by the following critical insights:</p>

        </div>
