                  to
                  <span>93.7%</span>
                </span>
                <div class="text-center">
                  <div class="fs-5 ff-roboto-serif text-secondary">Dropout Reduction Among Girls</div>
                  <p class="text-dark">Project Udaan reduced the dropout rate of girls in Rajasthan from 9% to 3.7%, demonstrating how scholarships and engagement can effectively keep girls in school.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3">
              <div class="text_with_icon xxxl align-items-center flex-column gap-4 mb-1">
